273
00:16:58,680 --> 00:17:01,257
Before I take another
breath, is that right?

274
00:17:01,340 --> 00:17:02,600
Well, I'll do that!

275
00:17:05,400 --> 00:17:07,060
I'll do that right!

276
00:17:13,260 --> 00:17:15,237
What did you do...

277
