295
00:18:17,840 --> 00:18:18,937
Who cares what it was?

296
00:18:19,020 --> 00:18:21,237
Now I need to disinfect my tongue, okay?

297
00:18:21,320 --> 00:18:22,937
Give me the medicine already.

298
00:18:23,020 --> 00:18:25,077
I thought I just heard the word toilet.

299
00:18:25,160 --> 00:18:26,807
