304
00:18:36,700 --> 00:18:38,420
You shitty old man!

305
00:18:38,680 --> 00:18:40,445
You were just messing with me!

306
00:18:40,540 --> 00:18:41,716
Forget the medicine!

307
00:18:41,980 --> 00:18:43,857
All right, all right, I'm sorry.

308
00:18:43,940 --> 00:18:45,937
Come here and I'll fix you up, Polnareff.

309
